DeployCheckKitSlotTest
├── when the kit slot differs from the Ambire helper slot
│   └── it should pass
├── when the action sits at any address
│   └── it should pass
├── when the kit slot equals the Ambire helper slot
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should name the action and its kit slot
├── when a colliding action sits at any address
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should name the action and its kit slot
├── when the action address holds a contract without kit slot
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should name recoveryAction and the address in the read failure
├── when the kit slot answer is empty
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should name recoveryAction and the address in the read failure
└── when the kit slot answer has bits above an address
    ├── it should revert
    └── it should name recoveryAction and the address in the read failure
